            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Wiped Setup 1.1.6

- If an update fails, use Download update manually to open wiped.me/dashboard and get the latest Mac installer.
- Find the same manual download option anytime in the Wiped Setup menu.
- The required-update screen also opens the dashboard for manual downloads.

Download the DMG from your dashboard, open it, and drag Wiped Setup to Applications
to replace the older installer. Finish any current iPhone setup before replacing
the installer.
]]></description>
